{
  "title": "Stage 3: Issuing TLS leaves",
  "summary": "Issue server certificates with SANs and the serverAuth EKU from your intermediate.",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "learn",
      "title": "Briefing: the certificate a server actually uses",
      "body": [
        "Now the part people do every week: issuing a server certificate.",
        "",
        "`issue HOST [HOST...]` issues a leaf signed by the **most recent intermediate**:",
        "",
        "- Subject `CN=` + the first host; **every** host goes in the Subject Alternative Name (browsers ignore the CN)",
        "- Basic Constraints not a CA (critical), Key Usage `DigitalSignature` (critical), EKU **serverAuth** `1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1`",
        "- valid **2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01** (publicly trusted certificates may last at most 200 days since March 2026, 100 from March 2027 and 47 from March 2029; a private CA sets its own limit, and short is still wise)",
        "",
        "The openssl twin is an extfile with `basicConstraints = critical, CA:FALSE`, `keyUsage = critical, digitalSignature`, `extendedKeyUsage = serverAuth` and `subjectAltName = DNS:shop.example, DNS:www.shop.example`.",
        "",
        "```text",
        "> root Dojo Root",
        "> intermediate Issuing CA",
        "> issue shop.example www.shop.example",
        "> show shop.example",
        "created root CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01)",
        "created intermediate CN=Issuing CA under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
        "issued CN=shop.example by CN=Issuing CA (2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01) for shop.example, www.shop.example",
        "CN=shop.example",
        "  issuer: CN=Issuing CA",
        "  ca: no",
        "  san: shop.example, www.shop.example",
        "  eku: serverAuth",
        "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sort",
      "prompt": "Which extension lines does each certificate get in mini-ca?",
      "buckets": [
        "Intermediate",
        "Leaf"
      ],
      "items": [
        [
          "`CA:TRUE, pathlen:0`",
          0
        ],
        [
          "`keyCertSign, cRLSign`",
          0
        ],
        [
          "`CA:FALSE`",
          1
        ],
        [
          "`digitalSignature`",
          1
        ],
        [
          "EKU `serverAuth`",
          1
        ],
        [
          "SAN `DNS:shop.example`",
          1
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "blanks",
      "prompt": "Complete the SAN code for every host.",
      "code": [
        "var san = new __1__();",
        "foreach (var h in hosts) san.__2__(h);",
        "req.CertificateExtensions.Add(san.__3__());"
      ],
      "blanks": [
        "SubjectAlternativeNameBuilder",
        "AddDnsName",
        "Build"
      ],
      "bank": [
        "X509SubjectAlternativeNameExtension",
        "AddUri",
        "Create",
        "AddHost"
      ],
      "explain": "`SubjectAlternativeNameBuilder` collects names and `Build()` turns them into the extension."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "prompt": "`show` reads the SAN and EKU back from the certificate. What does this print?",
      "code": [
        "using System.Security.Cryptography;",
        "using System.Security.Cryptography.X509Certificates;",
        "var key = ECDsa.Create(ECCurve.NamedCurves.nistP256);",
        "var req = new CertificateRequest(\"CN=shop.example\", key, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);",
        "var b = new SubjectAlternativeNameBuilder();",
        "b.AddDnsName(\"shop.example\");",
        "b.AddDnsName(\"www.shop.example\");",
        "req.CertificateExtensions.Add(b.Build());",
        "req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509EnhancedKeyUsageExtension(new OidCollection { new Oid(\"1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1\") }, false));",
        "using var cert = req.CreateSelfSigned(DateTimeOffset.UnixEpoch, DateTimeOffset.UnixEpoch.AddDays(1));",
        "var san = cert.Extensions.OfType<X509SubjectAlternativeNameExtension>().Single();",
        "Console.WriteLine(string.Join(\", \", san.EnumerateDnsNames()));",
        "var eku = cert.Extensions.OfType<X509EnhancedKeyUsageExtension>().Single();",
        "Console.WriteLine(eku.EnhancedKeyUsages[0].Value);"
      ],
      "answer": [
        "shop.example, www.shop.example",
        "1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1"
      ],
      "explain": "`EnumerateDnsNames()` gives the DNS entries in order. EKUs are OIDs; mini-ca maps `1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1` to the name `serverAuth` itself, because `FriendlyName` depends on the operating system's language."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "mode": "write",
      "title": "mini-ca: issue leaves",
      "prompt": [
        "Extend mini-ca with `issue HOST [HOST...]`:",
        "",
        "| Input | Prints |",
        "|---|---|",
        "| `issue shop.example www.shop.example` | `issued CN=shop.example by CN=INTERMEDIATE (2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01) for shop.example, www.shop.example` |",
        "",
        "- The leaf's name (for `show` and `list`) is the first host; its kind is `leaf`.",
        "- Errors: no hosts `error: issue needs at least one host`; no intermediate yet `error: no intermediate yet`; first host already used `error: 'HOST' already exists`.",
        "- `show` prints `  san: ...` (DNS names, comma-separated) and `  eku: ...` (`serverAuth`, `clientAuth`, else the OID) after the `ca:` line, **only when the certificate has them**.",
        "",
        "```text",
        "> root Dojo Root",
        "> intermediate Issuing CA",
        "> issue shop.example www.shop.example",
        "> show shop.example",
        "created root CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01)",
        "created intermediate CN=Issuing CA under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
        "issued CN=shop.example by CN=Issuing CA (2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01) for shop.example, www.shop.example",
        "CN=shop.example",
        "  issuer: CN=Issuing CA",
        "  ca: no",
        "  san: shop.example, www.shop.example",
        "  eku: serverAuth",
        "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01",
        "```",
        "",
        "Roots and intermediates have no SAN or EKU, so their `show` output is unchanged."
      ],
      "starter": [
        "using System.Security.Cryptography;",
        "using System.Security.Cryptography.X509Certificates;",
        "",
        "var certs = new Dictionary<string, Entry>();",
        "var order = new List<string>();",
        "int serials = 0;",
        "Entry? currentRoot = null;",
        "",
        "string? line;",
        "while ((line = Console.ReadLine()) != null)",
        "{",
        "    line = line.Trim();",
        "    if (line.Length == 0 || line.StartsWith(\"#\")) continue;",
        "    int space = line.IndexOf(' ');",
        "    string cmd = space < 0 ? line : line[..space];",
        "    string arg = space < 0 ? \"\" : line[(space + 1)..].Trim();",
        "    switch (cmd)",
        "    {",
        "        case \"root\":",
        "        {",
        "            if (arg == \"\") { Console.WriteLine(\"error: root needs a name\"); break; }",
        "            if (certs.ContainsKey(arg)) { Console.WriteLine($\"error: '{arg}' already exists\"); break; }",
        "           var made = currentRoot = Add(MakeRoot(arg));",
        "            Console.WriteLine($\"created root {made.Cert.Subject} ({Dates(made.Cert)})\");",
        "            break;",
        "        }",
        "       case \"intermediate\":",
        "       {",
        "           if (arg == \"\") { Console.WriteLine(\"error: intermediate needs a name\"); break; }",
        "           if (certs.ContainsKey(arg)) { Console.WriteLine($\"error: '{arg}' already exists\"); break; }",
        "           if (currentRoot == null) { Console.WriteLine(\"error: no root yet\"); break; }",
        "           var made = Add(MakeIntermediate(arg, currentRoot));",
        "           Console.WriteLine($\"created intermediate {made.Cert.Subject} under {currentRoot.Cert.Subject} ({Dates(made.Cert)})\");",
        "           break;",
        "       }",
        "        case \"show\":",
        "        {",
        "            var found = Find(arg);",
        "            if (found != null) Show(found);",
        "            break;",
        "        }",
        "        case \"list\":",
        "        {",
        "            foreach (var name in order)",
        "            {",
        "                var x = certs[name];",
        "                Console.WriteLine(x.Parent == null ? $\"{x.Kind} {x.Cert.Subject}\" : $\"{x.Kind} {x.Cert.Subject} (issued by {x.Parent.Cert.Subject})\");",
        "            }",
        "            break;",
        "        }",
        "        default:",
        "            Console.WriteLine($\"error: unknown command '{cmd}'\");",
        "            break;",
        "    }",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry Add(Entry entry)",
        "{",
        "    certs[entry.Name] = entry;",
        "    order.Add(entry.Name);",
        "    return entry;",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry? Find(string name)",
        "{",
        "    if (certs.TryGetValue(name, out var found)) return found;",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"error: no certificate named '{name}'\");",
        "    return null;",
        "}",
        "",
        "byte[] Serial() => new byte[] { 0x01, (byte)++serials };",
        "",
        "Entry MakeRoot(string name)",
        "{",
        "    var key = ECDsa.Create(ECCurve.NamedCurves.nistP256);",
        "    var req = new CertificateRequest(\"CN=\" + name, key, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509BasicConstraintsExtension(true, false, 0, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509KeyUsageExtension(X509KeyUsageFlags.KeyCertSign | X509KeyUsageFlags.CrlSign, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509SubjectKeyIdentifierExtension(req.PublicKey, false));",
        "    return new Entry(name, \"root\", req.CreateSelfSigned(Day(2030), Day(2050)), null);",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry MakeIntermediate(string name, Entry parent)",
        "{",
        "    var key = ECDsa.Create(ECCurve.NamedCurves.nistP256);",
        "    var req = new CertificateRequest(\"CN=\" + name, key, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509BasicConstraintsExtension(true, true, 0, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509KeyUsageExtension(X509KeyUsageFlags.KeyCertSign | X509KeyUsageFlags.CrlSign, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509SubjectKeyIdentifierExtension(req.PublicKey, false));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(X509AuthorityKeyIdentifierExtension.CreateFromCertificate(parent.Cert, true, false));",
        "    using var pub = req.Create(parent.Cert, Day(2030), Day(2040), Serial());",
        "    return new Entry(name, \"intermediate\", pub.CopyWithPrivateKey(key), parent);",
        "}",
        "",
        "void Show(Entry entry)",
        "{",
        "    var c = entry.Cert;",
        "    Console.WriteLine(c.Subject);",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"  issuer: {c.Issuer}\");",
        "    var bc = c.Extensions.OfType<X509BasicConstraintsExtension>().FirstOrDefault();",
        "   string ca = bc == null || !bc.CertificateAuthority ? \"no\"",
        "       : bc.HasPathLengthConstraint ? $\"yes, pathlen {bc.PathLengthConstraint}\" : \"yes, no pathlen limit\";",
        "   Console.WriteLine($\"  ca: {ca}\");",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"  valid: {Dates(c)}\");",
        "}",
        "",
        "static DateTimeOffset Day(int year) => new DateTimeOffset(year, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, TimeSpan.Zero);",
        "static string Ymd(DateTime t) => t.ToUniversalTime().ToString(\"yyyy-MM-dd\");",
        "static string Dates(X509Certificate2 c) => $\"{Ymd(c.NotBefore)} to {Ymd(c.NotAfter)}\";",
        "",
        "record Entry(string Name, string Kind, X509Certificate2 Cert, Entry? Parent);"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "using System.Security.Cryptography;",
        "using System.Security.Cryptography.X509Certificates;",
        "",
        "var certs = new Dictionary<string, Entry>();",
        "var order = new List<string>();",
        "int serials = 0;",
        "Entry? currentRoot = null;",
        "Entry? currentInter = null;",
        "",
        "string? line;",
        "while ((line = Console.ReadLine()) != null)",
        "{",
        "    line = line.Trim();",
        "    if (line.Length == 0 || line.StartsWith(\"#\")) continue;",
        "    int space = line.IndexOf(' ');",
        "    string cmd = space < 0 ? line : line[..space];",
        "    string arg = space < 0 ? \"\" : line[(space + 1)..].Trim();",
        "    switch (cmd)",
        "    {",
        "        case \"root\":",
        "        {",
        "            if (arg == \"\") { Console.WriteLine(\"error: root needs a name\"); break; }",
        "            if (certs.ContainsKey(arg)) { Console.WriteLine($\"error: '{arg}' already exists\"); break; }",
        "           var made = currentRoot = Add(MakeRoot(arg));",
        "            Console.WriteLine($\"created root {made.Cert.Subject} ({Dates(made.Cert)})\");",
        "            break;",
        "        }",
        "       case \"intermediate\":",
        "       {",
        "           if (arg == \"\") { Console.WriteLine(\"error: intermediate needs a name\"); break; }",
        "           if (certs.ContainsKey(arg)) { Console.WriteLine($\"error: '{arg}' already exists\"); break; }",
        "           if (currentRoot == null) { Console.WriteLine(\"error: no root yet\"); break; }",
        "           var made = currentInter = Add(MakeIntermediate(arg, currentRoot));",
        "           Console.WriteLine($\"created intermediate {made.Cert.Subject} under {currentRoot.Cert.Subject} ({Dates(made.Cert)})\");",
        "           break;",
        "       }",
        "       case \"issue\":",
        "       {",
        "           var hosts = arg.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries);",
        "           if (hosts.Length == 0) { Console.WriteLine(\"error: issue needs at least one host\"); break; }",
        "           if (certs.ContainsKey(hosts[0])) { Console.WriteLine($\"error: '{hosts[0]}' already exists\"); break; }",
        "           if (currentInter == null) { Console.WriteLine(\"error: no intermediate yet\"); break; }",
        "           var made = Add(MakeLeaf(hosts, currentInter));",
        "           Console.WriteLine($\"issued {made.Cert.Subject} by {currentInter.Cert.Subject} ({Dates(made.Cert)}) for {string.Join(\", \", hosts)}\");",
        "           break;",
        "       }",
        "        case \"show\":",
        "        {",
        "            var found = Find(arg);",
        "            if (found != null) Show(found);",
        "            break;",
        "        }",
        "        case \"list\":",
        "        {",
        "            foreach (var name in order)",
        "            {",
        "                var x = certs[name];",
        "                Console.WriteLine(x.Parent == null ? $\"{x.Kind} {x.Cert.Subject}\" : $\"{x.Kind} {x.Cert.Subject} (issued by {x.Parent.Cert.Subject})\");",
        "            }",
        "            break;",
        "        }",
        "        default:",
        "            Console.WriteLine($\"error: unknown command '{cmd}'\");",
        "            break;",
        "    }",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry Add(Entry entry)",
        "{",
        "    certs[entry.Name] = entry;",
        "    order.Add(entry.Name);",
        "    return entry;",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry? Find(string name)",
        "{",
        "    if (certs.TryGetValue(name, out var found)) return found;",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"error: no certificate named '{name}'\");",
        "    return null;",
        "}",
        "",
        "byte[] Serial() => new byte[] { 0x01, (byte)++serials };",
        "",
        "Entry MakeRoot(string name)",
        "{",
        "    var key = ECDsa.Create(ECCurve.NamedCurves.nistP256);",
        "    var req = new CertificateRequest(\"CN=\" + name, key, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509BasicConstraintsExtension(true, false, 0, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509KeyUsageExtension(X509KeyUsageFlags.KeyCertSign | X509KeyUsageFlags.CrlSign, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509SubjectKeyIdentifierExtension(req.PublicKey, false));",
        "    return new Entry(name, \"root\", req.CreateSelfSigned(Day(2030), Day(2050)), null);",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry MakeIntermediate(string name, Entry parent)",
        "{",
        "    var key = ECDsa.Create(ECCurve.NamedCurves.nistP256);",
        "    var req = new CertificateRequest(\"CN=\" + name, key, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509BasicConstraintsExtension(true, true, 0, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509KeyUsageExtension(X509KeyUsageFlags.KeyCertSign | X509KeyUsageFlags.CrlSign, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509SubjectKeyIdentifierExtension(req.PublicKey, false));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(X509AuthorityKeyIdentifierExtension.CreateFromCertificate(parent.Cert, true, false));",
        "    using var pub = req.Create(parent.Cert, Day(2030), Day(2040), Serial());",
        "    return new Entry(name, \"intermediate\", pub.CopyWithPrivateKey(key), parent);",
        "}",
        "",
        "Entry MakeLeaf(string[] hosts, Entry parent)",
        "{",
        "    var key = ECDsa.Create(ECCurve.NamedCurves.nistP256);",
        "    var req = new CertificateRequest(\"CN=\" + hosts[0], key, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509BasicConstraintsExtension(false, false, 0, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509KeyUsageExtension(X509KeyUsageFlags.DigitalSignature, true));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509EnhancedKeyUsageExtension(new OidCollection { new Oid(\"1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1\") }, false));",
        "    var san = new SubjectAlternativeNameBuilder();",
        "    foreach (var h in hosts) san.AddDnsName(h);",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(san.Build());",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(new X509SubjectKeyIdentifierExtension(req.PublicKey, false));",
        "    req.CertificateExtensions.Add(X509AuthorityKeyIdentifierExtension.CreateFromCertificate(parent.Cert, true, false));",
        "    using var pub = req.Create(parent.Cert, Day(2030), Day(2031), Serial());",
        "    return new Entry(hosts[0], \"leaf\", pub.CopyWithPrivateKey(key), parent);",
        "}",
        "",
        "void Show(Entry entry)",
        "{",
        "    var c = entry.Cert;",
        "    Console.WriteLine(c.Subject);",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"  issuer: {c.Issuer}\");",
        "    var bc = c.Extensions.OfType<X509BasicConstraintsExtension>().FirstOrDefault();",
        "   string ca = bc == null || !bc.CertificateAuthority ? \"no\"",
        "       : bc.HasPathLengthConstraint ? $\"yes, pathlen {bc.PathLengthConstraint}\" : \"yes, no pathlen limit\";",
        "   Console.WriteLine($\"  ca: {ca}\");",
        "   var san = c.Extensions.OfType<X509SubjectAlternativeNameExtension>().FirstOrDefault();",
        "   if (san != null) Console.WriteLine($\"  san: {string.Join(\", \", san.EnumerateDnsNames())}\");",
        "   var eku = c.Extensions.OfType<X509EnhancedKeyUsageExtension>().FirstOrDefault();",
        "   if (eku != null) Console.WriteLine($\"  eku: {string.Join(\", \", eku.EnhancedKeyUsages.Cast<Oid>().Select(o => EkuName(o.Value)))}\");",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"  valid: {Dates(c)}\");",
        "}",
        "",
        "static DateTimeOffset Day(int year) => new DateTimeOffset(year, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, TimeSpan.Zero);",
        "static string Ymd(DateTime t) => t.ToUniversalTime().ToString(\"yyyy-MM-dd\");",
        "static string Dates(X509Certificate2 c) => $\"{Ymd(c.NotBefore)} to {Ymd(c.NotAfter)}\";",
        "static string EkuName(string? oid) => oid switch",
        "{",
        "    \"1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1\" => \"serverAuth\",",
        "    \"1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.2\" => \"clientAuth\",",
        "    _ => oid ?? \"unknown\"",
        "};",
        "",
        "record Entry(string Name, string Kind, X509Certificate2 Cert, Entry? Parent);"
      ],
      "hints": [
        "Track `Entry? currentInter` and set it when an intermediate is made.",
        "`MakeLeaf(string[] hosts, Entry parent)` mirrors `MakeIntermediate` with the leaf extensions and `Day(2031)`.",
        "In `Show`: `var san = c.Extensions.OfType<X509SubjectAlternativeNameExtension>().FirstOrDefault(); if (san != null) ...`"
      ],
      "carry": true,
      "tests": [
        {
          "name": "issues a leaf with SANs",
          "stdin": [
            "root Dojo Root",
            "intermediate Issuing CA",
            "issue shop.example www.shop.example",
            "show shop.example"
          ],
          "expect": [
            "created root CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01)",
            "created intermediate CN=Issuing CA under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
            "issued CN=shop.example by CN=Issuing CA (2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01) for shop.example, www.shop.example",
            "CN=shop.example",
            "  issuer: CN=Issuing CA",
            "  ca: no",
            "  san: shop.example, www.shop.example",
            "  eku: serverAuth",
            "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "needs an intermediate first",
          "stdin": [
            "root Dojo Root",
            "issue shop.example",
            "intermediate Issuing CA",
            "issue",
            "issue shop.example",
            "issue shop.example",
            "list"
          ],
          "expect": [
            "created root CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01)",
            "error: no intermediate yet",
            "created intermediate CN=Issuing CA under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
            "error: issue needs at least one host",
            "issued CN=shop.example by CN=Issuing CA (2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01) for shop.example",
            "error: 'shop.example' already exists",
            "root CN=Dojo Root",
            "intermediate CN=Issuing CA (issued by CN=Dojo Root)",
            "leaf CN=shop.example (issued by CN=Issuing CA)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "signs with the most recent intermediate",
          "stdin": [
            "root Dojo Root",
            "intermediate CA One",
            "intermediate CA Two",
            "issue api.example",
            "show api.example",
            "show CA Two"
          ],
          "expect": [
            "created root CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01)",
            "created intermediate CN=CA One under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
            "created intermediate CN=CA Two under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
            "issued CN=api.example by CN=CA Two (2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01) for api.example",
            "CN=api.example",
            "  issuer: CN=CA Two",
            "  ca: no",
            "  san: api.example",
            "  eku: serverAuth",
            "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2031-01-01",
            "CN=CA Two",
            "  issuer: CN=Dojo Root",
            "  ca: yes, pathlen 0",
            "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "still passes: issues an intermediate under the root",
          "stdin": [
            "root Dojo Root",
            "intermediate Issuing CA",
            "show Issuing CA",
            "show Dojo Root"
          ],
          "expect": [
            "created root CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01)",
            "created intermediate CN=Issuing CA under CN=Dojo Root (2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01)",
            "CN=Issuing CA",
            "  issuer: CN=Dojo Root",
            "  ca: yes, pathlen 0",
            "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2040-01-01",
            "CN=Dojo Root",
            "  issuer: CN=Dojo Root",
            "  ca: yes, no pathlen limit",
            "  valid: 2030-01-01 to 2050-01-01"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
